# Disaster Recovery of Workloads on AWS: Recovery in the Cloud AWS Well-Architected Framework

> This paper outlines the best practices for planning and testing disaster recovery for any workload deployed to AWS, and offers different approaches to improve resilience and mitigate risks and meet the Recovery Time Objective (RTO) and Recovery Point Objective (RPO) for that workload.

